Oh!

269
00:20:59,938 --> 00:21:01,938
Turret, I just lost my train of thought.

270
00:21:03,938 --> 00:21:04,938
Oh, my God!

271
00:21:04,938 --> 00:21:06,938
That sounded like it came straight from the pits of hell.

272
00:21:06,938 --> 00:21:08,938
45 degrees slant!

273
00:21:08,938 --> 00:21:10,938
Wait, no! Should it be 60?

274
00:21:10,938 --> 00:21:11,938
Oh!

275
00:21:11,938 --> 00:21:15,938
How could I fall into such an awful slump?

276
00:21:15,938 --> 00:21:18,938
Is this my punishment for all those panties?

277
00:21:19,938 --> 00:21:21,938
Oh, my.

278
00:21:21,938 --> 00:21:30,938
Save your strength, Roronoa Zoro.

279
00:21:30,938 --> 00:21:33,938
Your wounds are too severe to ignore any longer.

280
00:21:33,938 --> 00:21:38,938
And to be quite frank, you have no hope of defeating me if you lost to those apes.

281
00:21:38,938 --> 00:21:41,938
Yeah, well, what the hell are you doing here?

282
00:21:42,938 --> 00:21:45,938
I've been living in that castle for a while now.

283
00:21:45,938 --> 00:21:47,938
What brings you here?

284
00:21:47,938 --> 00:21:50,938
That would be one of your seven warlords, pals.

285
00:21:50,938 --> 00:21:52,938
Kuma sent the whole crew flying.

286
00:21:53,938 --> 00:21:54,938
I see.

287
00:21:54,938 --> 00:21:56,938
That explains things, then.

288
00:21:56,938 --> 00:21:59,938
Straw Hat was fighting with a different group in Marineford.

289
00:22:00,938 --> 00:22:02,938
Hold on, did you see Luffy?

290
00:22:02,938 --> 00:22:03,938
Is he all right?

291
00:22:03,938 --> 00:22:04,938
What was he doing?

292
00:22:04,938 --> 00:22:06,938
He should still be alive.

293
00:22:06,938 --> 00:22:10,938
But as he left the battle, he appeared to be severely traumatized.

294
00:22:10,938 --> 00:22:11,938
Why's that?

295
00:22:16,938 --> 00:22:19,938
Don't you know his brother is dead?

296
00:22:23,938 --> 00:22:24,938
It can't be!

297
00:22:24,938 --> 00:22:26,938
And you're certain that's true?

298
00:22:27,938 --> 00:22:28,938
Oh, no!

299
00:22:29,938 --> 00:22:30,938
No way!

300
00:22:30,938 --> 00:22:31,938
Really?

301
00:22:31,938 --> 00:22:33,938
How can this be happening?

302
00:22:37,938 --> 00:22:39,938
I can't believe it.

303
00:22:39,938 --> 00:22:41,938
Fire Fist Ace died.

304
00:22:42,938 --> 00:22:45,938
Right before Straw Hat's eyes.

305
00:22:45,938 --> 00:22:46,938
Oh!

306
00:22:50,938 --> 00:22:51,938
Luffy!

307
00:22:52,938 --> 00:22:53,938
Luffy!

308
00:22:53,938 --> 00:22:54,938
Luffy!

309
00:23:09,938 --> 00:23:14,938
Determined to return to Sabaody and keep his promise to his crew, Luffy prepares for departure.

310
00:23:14,938 --> 00:23:24,938
However, when Dark King Rayleigh appears and makes him a surprising offer, Luffy is forced to make a decision that could alter the fate of his entire journey on the Grand Line.

311
00:23:24,938 --> 00:23:32,938
On the next One Piece, reunited with Dark King Rayleigh, decision time for Luffy, I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!

